{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6366889023707740323,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "RCU (Read-Copy-Update)",
      "source_hash": 14529873974826463112,
      "context_hash": 11349998021928878318,
      "translation": "RCU (Read-Copy-Update)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RCU": "RCU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022958Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Lock-free reads through grace periods — the highest-performance synchronization in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 17172916594230932832,
      "context_hash": 6496704402455279638,
      "translation": "grace period를 통한 락 없는 읽기 — 커널에서 가장 성능이 높은 동기화 기법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "grace periods": "grace period",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The core idea",
      "source_hash": 15922500070673345573,
      "context_hash": 3723865224411230359,
      "translation": "핵심 아이디어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "RCU was added to Linux in kernel 2.5.43 (October 2002) by Dipankar Sarma (IBM) and Paul E. McKenney — confirmed in [\"What is RCU, Fundamentally?\"](https://lwn.net/Articles/262464/) (McKenney & Walpole, LWN 2007): *\"RCU added to the Linux kernel in October 2002.\"*",
      "source_hash": 13012443979909154383,
      "context_hash": 14633308832258609834,
      "translation": "RCU는 커널 2.5.43(2002년 10월)에서 Dipankar Sarma(IBM)와 Paul E. McKenney에 의해 Linux에 추가되었으며, 이는 [\"What is RCU, Fundamentally?\"](https://lwn.net/Articles/262464/)(McKenney & Walpole, LWN 2007)에서 확인됩니다: *\"RCU는 2002년 10월에 Linux 커널에 추가되었습니다.\"*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "Linux kernel": "Linux 커널",
        "RCU": "RCU",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "RCU solves a specific problem: how do you allow many readers to access a data structure with zero synchronization overhead, while still allowing writers to modify it safely?",
      "source_hash": 18204331460504454158,
      "context_hash": 5480841648273815581,
      "translation": "RCU는 특정한 문제를 해결합니다. 다수의 reader가 동기화 오버헤드 없이 자료 구조에 접근하도록 허용하면서도, writer가 이를 안전하게 수정할 수 있게 하려면 어떻게 해야 할까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RCU": "RCU",
        "data structure": "자료 구조",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The insight: **readers never modify the data**, so they can run truly concurrently as long as the writer doesn't free the old data until all readers that could see it have finished.",
      "source_hash": 6798803811105790575,
      "context_hash": 3141907513865656507,
      "translation": "핵심 통찰은 **reader는 데이터를 절대 수정하지 않는다**는 점이며, 따라서 writer가 이전 데이터를 볼 수 있는 모든 reader가 끝날 때까지 그 데이터를 해제하지 않는 한 reader들은 진정으로 동시에 실행될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022960Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The critical property: **readers pay almost nothing**.",
      "source_hash": 18364307814772427555,
      "context_hash": 5362081764443543763,
      "translation": "결정적인 특성은 **reader가 치르는 비용이 거의 없다**는 점입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022960Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "On non-preemptible kernels, `rcu_read_lock()` is literally a compiler barrier with preemption disabled — no atomic operations, no cache line bouncing.",
      "source_hash": 11711698498290285225,
      "context_hash": 6765289103304055339,
      "translation": "선점 불가능한 커널에서 `rcu_read_lock()`는 말 그대로 선점이 비활성화된 컴파일러 배리어일 뿐이며, 원자적 연산도 캐시 라인 바운싱도 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cache": "캐시",
        "kernels": "커널",
        "preemption": "선점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022960Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The grace period",
      "source_hash": 10756031328729211566,
      "context_hash": 13003558115649355837,
      "translation": "grace period",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "grace period": "grace period"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A **grace period** is the time the writer waits after publishing the new pointer before freeing the old one.",
      "source_hash": 10218006276762520113,
      "context_hash": 8206108004361258563,
      "translation": "**grace period**는 writer가 새 포인터를 게시한 후 이전 포인터를 해제하기 전까지 기다리는 시간입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "grace period": "grace period"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A grace period ends when every CPU has passed through a **quiescent state** — a point where no RCU read-side critical section can be in progress.",
      "source_hash": 5376317907092205382,
      "context_hash": 4903343265781477669,
      "translation": "grace period는 모든 CPU가 **quiescent state**, 즉 어떤 RCU 읽기 측 임계 구역도 진행 중일 수 없는 지점을 통과했을 때 끝납니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "RCU": "RCU",
        "critical section": "임계 구역",
        "grace period": "grace period"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Quiescent states include:",
      "source_hash": 7354559455740113600,
      "context_hash": 12134918819191262312,
      "translation": "quiescent state에는 다음이 포함됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Context switch (the CPU was preempted)",
      "source_hash": 11976281665301668142,
      "context_hash": 16879909387335290019,
      "translation": "컨텍스트 스위치(CPU가 선점됨)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "context switch": "컨텍스트 스위치"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Idle (the CPU has no work)",
      "source_hash": 2776030617594142529,
      "context_hash": 16123245237727784309,
      "translation": "유휴(CPU에 할 일이 없음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "User mode execution",
      "source_hash": 1012929610026701490,
      "context_hash": 18411486704472883575,
      "translation": "사용자 모드 실행",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022961Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "On a non-preemptible kernel, a grace period completes when every CPU has scheduled at least once.",
      "source_hash": 11264697584721097670,
      "context_hash": 6832045875844434168,
      "translation": "선점 불가능한 커널에서는 모든 CPU가 최소 한 번 스케줄링되면 grace period가 완료됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "grace period": "grace period",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "This is why context switches are RCU quiescent states.",
      "source_hash": 4449707337796170761,
      "context_hash": 2732335321502460091,
      "translation": "이것이 컨텍스트 스위치가 RCU quiescent state인 이유입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RCU": "RCU",
        "context switches": "컨텍스트 스위치"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "API",
      "source_hash": 17306549135961116108,
      "context_hash": 214310280299331887,
      "translation": "API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Embedding rcu_head",
      "source_hash": 7497759264419864059,
      "context_hash": 17888107244637958287,
      "translation": "rcu_head 임베딩",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Any object freed via RCU must embed `struct rcu_head`:",
      "source_hash": 7973884004953796128,
      "context_hash": 5980483568972551859,
      "translation": "RCU를 통해 해제되는 모든 객체는 `struct rcu_head`를 포함해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RCU": "RCU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "kfree_rcu shorthand",
      "source_hash": 1198466605553391857,
      "context_hash": 4125403224915010471,
      "translation": "kfree_rcu 축약형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022962Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "For objects that just need `kfree()` after a grace period, `kfree_rcu()` is a shorthand that avoids writing a callback:",
      "source_hash": 17375338663633590329,
      "context_hash": 8349286687642862752,
      "translation": "grace period 후에 `kfree()`만 호출하면 되는 객체의 경우, `kfree_rcu()`는 콜백을 작성하지 않아도 되는 축약형입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백",
        "grace period": "grace period"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:55.022963Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "A complete example: RCU-protected lookup table",
      "source_hash": 14168980845251938262,
      "context_hash": 12141090107905681317,
      "translation": "전체 예제: RCU로 보호되는 조회 테이블",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RCU": "RCU"
